sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Park visitor
  participant SITE as SuperPark website
  participant PARK as Park or checkout
  participant VIEW as Loyalty View (Web or PWA)
  participant API as Loyalty App API
  participant DB as App Database
  participant MSG as PATCH or Email

  U->>SITE: Open SuperPark website
  SITE-->>U: Show loyalty entry point

  alt First-time customer enrollment
    U->>VIEW: Join with name, email, and phone
    VIEW-->>U: Confirm account is created
    Note over U,VIEW: The current park is used as the customer's home park when known.
  else Returning customer
    U->>VIEW: Open loyalty view
  end

  U->>VIEW: Enter email to access account
  VIEW->>API: Request magic link with normalized email
  API->>DB: Look up customer by email
  alt Account exists
    API->>DB: Store hashed one-time token with expiry
    API->>MSG: Send magic link email
    MSG-->>U: Deliver magic link
  else No matching account
    API-->>VIEW: Return neutral response
  end
  U->>VIEW: Open magic link
  VIEW->>API: Consume token
  API->>DB: Validate token, expiry, and unused state
  API-->>VIEW: Return session token
  VIEW-->>U: Show profile, stamp count, bookings, tickets, parks, waivers, and rewards

  U->>PARK: Buy park tickets
  PARK-->>U: Confirm booking
  U->>VIEW: Manual refresh: Refresh loyalty page
  VIEW-->>U: Show updated booking, ticket count, visited park, and stamps

  alt Booking is changed or canceled
    PARK-->>U: Confirm booking change
    U->>VIEW: Manual refresh: Refresh loyalty page
    VIEW-->>U: Show corrected booking and stamp state
  end

  alt Reward is available
    VIEW-->>U: Show reward code
    U->>PARK: Use reward code at checkout
    PARK-->>U: Apply discount when code is valid
  end

  U->>VIEW: Return later
  VIEW-->>U: Show latest account, bookings, tickets, stamps, parks, waivers, and rewards
